            "detailed_description": "<i>Akihabara</i> is a unique combination of intense rhythm and fast-paced puzzles set in the Electric Town of Tokyo! Stack and match shapes to 15 original songs and levels -- but don’t let them reach the top ... or it’s “game over”!<br><br>Try your tact at Pure Beat, removing all puzzles, focusing on just the beat and rhythm! Or challenge yourself using your own music library!<br><br>Can you earn a top spot on the leaderboards and master the rhythm in <i>Akihabara</i>?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge yourself with intense, fast-paced rhythm gameplay<br></li><li>Enjoy high-quality graphics, sound, and music<br></li><li>Track your online scores<br></li><li>Earn achievements in more than 15 levels in different game modes<br></li><li>Use your own music for unlimited replayability<br></li><li>Master the beat in environments based on Tokyo’s own Electric Town</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Akihabara</i> is a unique combination of intense rhythm and fast-paced puzzles set in the Electric Town of Tokyo! Stack and match shapes to 15 original songs and levels -- but don’t let them reach the top ... or it’s “game over”!<br><br>Try your tact at Pure Beat, removing all puzzles, focusing on just the beat and rhythm! Or challenge yourself using your own music library!<br><br>Can you earn a top spot on the leaderboards and master the rhythm in <i>Akihabara</i>?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge yourself with intense, fast-paced rhythm gameplay<br></li><li>Enjoy high-quality graphics, sound, and music<br></li><li>Track your online scores<br></li><li>Earn achievements in more than 15 levels in different game modes<br></li><li>Use your own music for unlimited replayability<br></li><li>Master the beat in environments based on Tokyo’s own Electric Town</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Akihabara is a unique combination of intense rhythm and fast-paced puzzles set in the Electric Town of Tokyo!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Japonês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
